# kinboot boot entries, written by kbuild. See docs/bootloader.md#boot-options.
timeout 5
default chain-test
on-failure firmware

entry normal
title KinTane
mode normal

entry safe
title KinTane (safe mode)
mode safe

entry recovery
title KinTane (recovery)
mode recovery

entry chain-test
title Chainload test
chain-partition 2
